```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Farmer as 🧑‍🌾 Farmer
    participant UI as 📱 AgroVision UI
    participant Riverpod as ⚙️ State Provider
    participant Classifier as 🧠 TFLite Classifier<br/>(Edge ML)
    participant Repo as 📦 DiagnosisRepository
    participant Storage as 📁 Cloud Storage
    participant Firestore as 🗄️ Cloud Firestore
    participant CloudFn as ⚡ Cloud Functions<br/>(onDiagnosisCreated)
    participant FCMFn as ⚡ Cloud Functions<br/>(onOutbreakAlertCreated)
    participant FCM as 🔔 FCM Service
    actor Neighbor as 🧑‍🌾 Neighboring Farmers

    Note over Farmer, Classifier: Phase 1: Edge Diagnosis (100% Offline Capable)
    Farmer->>UI: Snap leaf photo & tap 'Diagnose'
    UI->>Riverpod: Request classification(imagePath)
    Riverpod->>Classifier: classifyImage(imagePath)
    Classifier->>Classifier: Preprocess tensor & run quantized inference
    Classifier-->>Riverpod: Return predictedClass & confidenceScore
    Riverpod-->>UI: Display diagnosis, severity & treatment advice

    Note over Farmer, Firestore: Phase 2: Save Diagnosis (Local + Cloud Sync)
    Farmer->>UI: Tap 'Save Diagnosis to History'
    UI->>Repo: saveDiagnosis(diagnosisData, imageFile)
    Repo->>Repo: Store in local offline cache (immediate UI feedback)
    
    alt Online Connection Available
        Repo->>Storage: Upload compressed leaf image
        Storage-->>Repo: Return secure download imageUrl
        Repo->>Firestore: Create document in 'diagnoses' collection<br/>(predictedClass, geohash, location, timestamp)
        Firestore-->>Repo: Acknowledge document write
    else Offline Mode
        Repo-->>UI: Keep in pending sync queue; syncs automatically when online
    end
    Repo-->>UI: Confirm saved to History

    Note over Firestore, Neighbor: Phase 3: Outbreak Detection & Privacy-Preserving Alert
    Firestore->>CloudFn: Trigger onDiagnosisCreated(newDocSnapshot)
    CloudFn->>CloudFn: Read outbreak thresholds (radius: 10km, minReports: 5, window: 48h)
    CloudFn->>Firestore: Query recent diagnoses with matching disease & geohash neighbors
    
    alt Threshold Exceeded (Cluster Confirmed)
        CloudFn->>CloudFn: Calculate rounded centroid (GeoPoint obfuscation)
        CloudFn->>Firestore: Create document in 'outbreakAlerts'<br/>(diseaseType, centerPoint, radiusKm, reportCount)
        Firestore-->>CloudFn: Created alertId
        
        Firestore->>FCMFn: Trigger onOutbreakAlertCreated(newAlertSnapshot)
        FCMFn->>Firestore: Query affected users within radius (fcmTokens)
        FCMFn->>Firestore: Create individual 'notifications' records
        FCMFn->>FCM: Dispatch multicast FCM push payload<br/>(Privacy-safe: no victim names or exact coords)
        FCM-->>Neighbor: Deliver Outbreak Push Alert notification
    else Below Threshold
        CloudFn->>CloudFn: Log cluster count; no alert required yet
    end
```
